OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FQuite breezy
OL,6,Fwith scattered showers at first but
OL,7,Fbecoming largely dry with light winds
OL,8,Fby midnight. Clouding over from the
OL,9,Fsouth overnight with some rain in the
OL,10,Fsouth by morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloud and rain spread north
OL,13,Fthrough the morning and becoming
OL,14,Frather windy. Drier for a time in the
OL,15,Fafternoon before further heavy rain
OL,16,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
