OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, some
OL,7,Fheavy. Bright spells and scattered
OL,8,Fshowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,9,Fdry later. Bright spells and variable
OL,10,Fcloud on Thursday, becoming quite
OL,11,Fwindy later.
